('112.28.b.11.A',3,'A large volcanic eruption can cool Earth''s climate temporarily because ash and gases...','["cool the core", "create ocean currents", "trap more heat only", "reflect sunlight"]'::jsonb,3,'Particles in the air block some sunlight.','original'),
