('112.28.b.13.C',4,'Why are individuals with helpful adaptations more likely to pass on their genes?','["they mate more often by design", "they are more likely to survive and reproduce", "they live forever", "they never get sick"]'::jsonb,1,'Natural selection favors them.','original'),
